<title>HONG KONG: Swire shrs rise on talk of warrant issue.</title>
<headline>Swire shrs rise on talk of warrant issue.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swire Pacific Ltd A shares rose on Wednesday on talk of a possible covered warrant issue on the stock by a U.S. brokerage, brokers said.</p>
<p>Swire was up HK$1.00, or 1.48 percent, at HK$68.50 on volume of 660,055 shares in midday trade, with speculation that the warrant issuer would have to buy stock to cover the warrant fuelling demand, brokers said.  </p>
<p>The issue size is expected to be in the range of 75 million to 120 million warrants with a gearing ratio of 8.2 times and a premium of 22.15 percent.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
